=== Evidence summary (TASK-004 red) ===
Red run: 67 tests selected, 25 failures and 8 errors. Surefire AppendOnlyArchTest: 8 new NFR-02 existence checks fail while PolicyEntity, PolicyVersionEntity, PolicyTermEntity, PolicyStatusTransitionEntity and their repositories are absent. Failsafe: PolicyIssuanceIT, PolicyNumberingIT, PolicyViewIT, PolicyLogCaptureIT, PolicyBodyLimitIT and the extended RoleBoundaryIT fail because the issue, mine and detail endpoints answer 404 or 403 (assertion failures) and the policy tables do not exist (SQL errors on the row-count snapshots).
Failing tests cover AC-05.1 (issue 201 and number format, date window, products, mine, detail, allow-list), AC-05.2 (50 concurrent, contiguous, per product, first of year), AC-05.3 (REFERRED/DECLINED, second issue, 404s, same-application race), AC-05.4 (one transition, one version, term, audit), NFR-03.1 (log capture), NFR-04.1 (role boundary), NFR-04.3 (415) and NFR-04.4 (413, encoded path, chunked), NFR-02 (append-only entities and repositories).
